{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：09:04 2026-07-29 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今（29日）清晨6時44分，葵涌石蔭商場一名男子被發現倒臥商場平台位置，奄奄一息，懷疑由高處墮下，救護員接報到場，經檢驗後證實男事主當場不治。警方調查後獲悉事主65歲，相信從上址一梯間墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書。死因有待驗屍後確定。據悉，事主受經濟問題困擾而尋死。</p>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e8beb961e3f0fbc9c80494ae0d35667a/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-29_at_08_52_01.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6013ba214466cabbd14f5d8d2b924a90/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-29_at_08_52_04.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子倒斃石蔭商場平台。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/979b5baffe783042bf700010200d8bbd/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-29_at_08_52_03_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e7fbcc5b612332df665f6de4607fc325/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-29_at_08_52_02_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/97ea10233b98cee10b6cf7c9ae81757b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-29_at_08_52_02.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T02:58:33.031107+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}